*   **convenience_feature_score**: Features included power windows, electric/folding mirrors, rain-sensing wipers, remote boot opener, cruise control, parking aids (PARKTRONIC mentioned for later models/trims like AMG Line). Lacked modern features like 360 cameras, auto-park (standard on later trims), keyless entry/go on all models, etc. Above average for its time, but less so now.
